{"unit_id":"2NF__dsh-profile-bridge#card-zh","repo":"2NF/dsh-profile-bridge","commit":"6917177806fcff7d9def83a881c47f8936a70278","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-profile-bridge 是 DeepSeek Harness 桌面版的 profile 桥接插件，在设置页列出本机档案并让桌面版复用已有插件的 profile。Host 与浏览器端通过 RPC 配合，生成平台脚本，将 desktop 目录备份后链接到所选 profile，也可解除链接并恢复备份。页面展示当前档案、依赖、bundle 和操作日志，并检查切换目标。适合想让桌面版使用命令行或 Web profile 插件的用户。切换时应用会关闭，完成后需手动打开；无需 API 密钥或在线服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:254-266","index.js:53-95","lib/state.mjs:111-124","lib/helper.mjs:63-95"]}
{"unit_id":"2NF__dsh-profile-bridge#card-en","repo":"2NF/dsh-profile-bridge","commit":"6917177806fcff7d9def83a881c47f8936a70278","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-profile-bridge lets the DeepSeek Harness Desktop app use plugins from another local profile. Its settings page lists profiles and logs. A helper backs up and links the selected profile, or restores the backup. Switching closes the app; reopen it manually. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:254-266","index.js:53-95","lib/state.mjs:111-124","lib/helper.mjs:63-95"]}
